  "def_use": [
    "Constructor reads count16, first/last/listnext and prioritycontext only. Its+8parsed slot is neitherwrittennorread. Exactlyfourreturned16Bowners are retained separately byexternalcaller.",
    "Real main receives PROGRAM,-dump,/nologo,/headers only. Toolselection uses actual Tooltable/Dumper3; realfiles_initialize runs, noprivateglobalsetup.",
    "collect_arguments setsfirst_argumentNULL butdoesnot clearother_inputs. Bothuserarguments startslash, so classify_argument chooses globalswitches. append_argument_node writes distinctnew switch nodes; no newfilenamebranch/classification touches archive nodes.",
    "process_dump_options traverses switches, notother_inputs. It reads text/next only, matchesnologo/headers.",
    "dumper_main reads other_inputs.first/count, then eachArgument text0/original4/next12. Allthree passed values down to dump_file are twochar* and archiveBYTE1, never theArgument owner pointer.",
    "dump_file and descendants own only separateLibrary/Module/file-slot allocations plus borrowed filename strings. release_library_list frees its ownLibrary data, notArgumentnodes orcaller stringblock.",
    "No actualparameter/callback orglobalalias passesarchiveArgument pointers into symbol/switch processing; listglobals literalreaders outside thisselected graph (library/import processing) are notcalled. Unexpectedreachedreader/newfrontier holds.",
    "close_all_files operates customFileSlot/Page owners, neverArgument pointers. remove_temporary_inputs withactualToolkind3 traverseslibrary_files(count0), notother_inputs.",
    "Normalmain/dumper do not free/archiveArgument owners orcaller strings. The real CRTcontinuation only consumes savedmainresult/stack then existingstdlib cleanup/stdio, which has no archiveArgument pointer/callback registration. Cobjects have no implicitdestructors; no LINK_REPRO/env-drivenextra callback.",
    "Externalreport reads only defined0/4/12 nodewords and knownnames; raw+8maybesampled bydebugger/controller but never used/serialized/compared cross-image. Anyactualconsumer of+8 forcesHOLD, notinit/normalization."
  ],
  "lifetime": "Owned256Bnames+guards and argc4/argv5slots allocated byexternalcaller remainlive through4constructorcalls, actualmainreturn, externalreport andrealCRTexit. Nodes staymalloc-owned; outputfile slots use_strdup copies. No nested stepping/re-entryframework.",
  "continuation": "Existing sequential cdecl ownedstack/sentinel; first4callsconstructor then actualmain(4,argv). Preserve every ESP/nonvolatile return, save actualmainEAX, restore realCRTreturn50a85/initialstack+4 withthatresult. Nativewrap delegates __real_main sameargs thenreturns savedresult. No supportreturn leaks tostatus.",
